const List<GeoTopic> edsTopics = <GeoTopic>[
  GeoTopic(
    id: "human-body",
    title: "Insani Jism — Andar ki Duniya",
    subtitle: "Apne hi jism ke woh hisse jo tum ne kabhi dekhe nahi, lekin paper har saal poochta hai",
    portion: "eds",
    blocks: <LessonBlock>[
      LessonBlock.heading("Ye lesson kyun zaroori hai"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Everyday Science ke paper me insani jism par sawal lazmi ata hai. Kabhi poocha jata hai ke jism ki sab se lambi haddi konsi hai, kabhi ke khoon ko lal rang kis cheez se milta hai, kabhi ke universal donor konsa group hai. Masla ye hai ke ye cheezain tum ne kabhi apni aankh se dekhi hi nahi. Dil kaisa dikhta hai, gurda andar se kaisa hota hai, ye sab kitaab ke alfaaz ban kar reh jate hain, aur jo cheez zehen me banti hi nahi wo yaad bhi nahi rehti."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Is lesson me hum har uzu ko pehle dekhen ge. Main alfaaz se us ki tasveer banaunga — us ki shakal, us ka size, us ka rang, wo jism me kahan para hai. Phir samjhen ge ke wo kaam kesay karta hai. Aur aakhir me wo facts bataunga jo paper me dohraye jate hain. Jab tasveer zehen me ban jayegi to fact khud ba khud us tasveer ke sath chipak jayega, aur paper me sawal dekh kar tumhe kitaab nahi, apna jism yaad ayega."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Dil — jism ka pump"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pehle dil ko dekho. Apni mutthi band karo. Bas, tumhara dil takreeban itna hi bara hai, aur wazan me takreeban 300 gram. Ye tumhari chhati me, dono phuphron ke darmiyan, zara sa bayein taraf jhuka hua hai. Upar se ye chaura hai aur neeche se nokdaar, bilkul ulta latka hua aik mazboot sa thela. Ye gosht ka bana hai, lekin aam gosht jaisa nahi — ye wo khaas patha hai jo kabhi thakta nahi, kyunke tum so jao to bhi ye saari raat chalta rehta hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab isay beech se kaat kar dekho to andar chaar khane nazar ayen ge. Do upar wale chhote khane, jinhe atria kehte hain, aur do neeche wale bare aur mote khane, jinhe ventricles kehte hain. Beech me aik deewar hai jo dayein aur bayein hisse ko bilkul alag rakhti hai. Is deewar ka kaam samajh lo to aadha lesson yahin khatam ho jata hai. Dayein taraf wala hissa poore jism se istimal shuda, ganda khoon wasool karta hai — ganda se murad wo khoon jis ki oxygen khatam ho chuki hai. Dil is gande khoon ko phuphron me bhejta hai, wahan is me nayi oxygen bharti hai, aur saaf khoon bayein taraf wale hisse me wapas aata hai. Phir dil zor se dabta hai aur is saaf khoon ko poore jism me dhakel deta hai. Yani dil aik hi waqt me do kaam kar raha hai — aik taraf ganda khoon andar le raha hai, dusri taraf saaf khoon bahar bhej raha hai, aur beech wali deewar dono ko milne nahi deti."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Dil aik minute me takreeban 72 dafa dharakta hai. Ye number paper ka sab se pyara number hai, pakka yaad kar lo. Dil ki dharkan asal me is dabne aur khulne ki awaaz hai. Doctor jo aala seene par laga kar sunta hai, wo yehi sun raha hota hai."),
      LessonBlock.visual("Dil ki aik bari tasveer ho jo beech se kati hui dikhai de. Dayein hisse ko halkay neele rang se aur bayein hisse ko lal rang se rangna hai taake gande aur saaf khoon ka farq aik nazar me samajh aye. Chaaron khanon par label hon — right atrium, left atrium, right ventricle, left ventricle — aur beech wali deewar par bhi nishan ho. Dil ke upar aur neeche jane wali bari naliyon par teer ke nishan hon jo khoon ke behne ki simt dikhayen."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Khoon — jism ki delivery service"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Khoon ko hum aik lal rang ka pani samajhte hain, lekin asal me khoon aik poora shehar hai jo naliyon me safar kar raha hai. Aik baligh insaan ke jism me takreeban 5 litre khoon hota hai. Is khoon me aik halkay peele rang ka pani sa hissa hai jise plasma kehte hain, aur us pani me teen kisam ke chhote chhote khaliye teir rahe hain. Ye khaliye itne chhote hain ke aam aankh se nazar nahi ate, lekin main tumhe bata deta hun ke wo dikhte kesay hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pehle lal khaliye, jinhe red blood cells ya RBC kehte hain. Ye chhoti si gol plate jaisi shakal ke hain, beech se zara se dabe hue, bilkul chhoti si tikki ki tarah. In ki tadaad sab se zyada hai, lakhs aur karoron me. Khoon ka lal rang inhi ki wajah se hai, aur in ke andar aik cheez hai jise hemoglobin kehte hain. Hemoglobin hi asal me oxygen ko pakar kar jism ke har hisse tak le jata hai. Paper me sawal bilkul yun ata hai — khoon ka lal rang kis ki wajah se hai? Jawab hemoglobin hai. Ye aik line pakki kar lo."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Dusre safed khaliye, white blood cells ya WBC. Ye RBC se bare hote hain aur tadaad me kam. Inhe jism ke sipahi samajh lo. Jab koi jaraseem jism me ghusta hai to ye sipahi us par hamla karte hain aur usay khatam karte hain. Bimari me doctor khoon test karwa kar inhi ki tadaad dekhta hai, kyunke larai zoron par ho to sipahi barh jate hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Teesre platelets. Ye sab se chhote tukre hain aur in ka kaam hai khoon ko jamana. Jab kahin chot lagti hai aur khoon behne lagta hai to platelets wahan ja kar jaali si bana lete hain, khoon jam jata hai aur behna ruk jata hai. Agar platelets kam ho jayen to chhoti si chot par bhi khoon rukta nahi."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab khoon ke groups. Har insaan ke khoon ka aik group hota hai — A, B, AB ya O. Aur har group ke sath plus ya minus bhi lagta hai. Is me paper ke do fix sawal hain aur dono ko ghalat karna sab se aam ghalti hai. Pehla: universal donor, yani wo group jo har kisi ko khoon de sakta hai — ye hai O negative. Dusra: universal recipient, yani wo shakhs jo har group ka khoon le sakta hai — ye hai AB positive. Donor dene wala hai, recipient lene wala. Lafz par ghor karo, sawal hal ho jayega."),
      LessonBlock.visual("Aik nali ke andar khoon behta hua dikhaya jaye jis me teen kisam ke khaliye bare bare nazar ayen — lal tikki jaisi shakal wale RBC, un se bara gol safed WBC, aur chhote tukre platelets. Teeno par label hon. Neeche khoon ke chaar groupon ke chaar khane hon aur O negative par \"universal donor\" aur AB positive par \"universal recipient\" ka khaas nishan ho."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Aankh — jism ka camera"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Aankh ko bahar se hum bas aik gol cheez dekhte hain, lekin is ki banawat bilkul camera jaisi hai. Aankh aik gol gaind jaisi hai, aur is ke bilkul samne aik saaf sheshay jaisa ubhra hua hissa hai. Us ke peeche wo gol rang wala hissa hai jise iris kehte hain. Kisi ki aankhain kaali, kisi ki bhoori, kisi ki neeli — ye rang iris ka hi hai. Iris ke beech me wo kaala gol surakh hai jise putli, yani pupil, kehte hain. Ye putli chhoti bari hoti rehti hai. Tez roshni me ye sikur jati hai taake andar kam roshni jaye, aur andhere me ye phail jati hai taake zyada roshni andar ja sake. Bilkul camera ke shutter ki tarah."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Putli ke peeche lens hai — aik saaf, naram, ubhra hua shesha. Ye lens bahar se ane wali roshni ko morkar aankh ki pichli deewar par giata hai. Pichli deewar ko retina kehte hain, aur yahi asal screen hai. Yahan aik baat hai jo paper me bar bar ati hai aur sab ko heran karti hai: retina par banti hui tasveer ULTI banti hai. Jo cheez seedhi hai, us ka aks retina par ulta girta hai. Phir dimaagh us ultay aks ko seedha kar ke hamein dikhata hai. Yani hum asal me dimaagh se dekhte hain, aankh bas tasveer bana kar bhejti hai. Aankh se aik taar jati hai jise optic nerve kehte hain, yehi tasveer ki khabar dimaagh tak le jati hai."),
      LessonBlock.visual("Aankh ko side se kaat kar dikhaya jaye taake andar ke hisse nazar ayen. Samne se ane wali roshni ki lakeerain lens se guzar kar retina par ulti tasveer banati hui dikhayen, aur aik chhoti si teer wali lakeer se dikhaya jaye ke dimaagh isay seedha kar deta hai. Iris, pupil, lens aur retina par lazmi label hon."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Kaan — sunna aur tawazun"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Kaan ka jo hissa bahar nazar ata hai wo asal kaan ka sab se chhota hissa hai. Asal kaan khopdi ke andar chhupa hai aur is ke teen hisse hain. Bahar wala hissa wo nali hai jo andar aik bareek jhilli par ja kar khatam hoti hai, us jhilli ko kaan ka parda, yani eardrum, kehte hain. Awaaz is parde se takrati hai aur parda kaanpne lagta hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Parde ke peeche darmiyan wala hissa hai, aur yahan jism ki sab se hairan kun cheez rakhi hai — teen nihayat chhoti haddiyan. Ye teeno haddiyan mil kar bhi aik chaawal ke dane se bari nahi. In me sab se chhoti haddi ka naam stapes hai, aur ye poore jism ki sab se chhoti haddi hai. Ye paper ka fix sawal hai — jism ki sab se chhoti haddi konsi hai aur kahan hai? Jawab: stapes, kaan me. Ye teenon haddiyan parde ki kaanp ko barha kar andar wale hisse tak pohnchati hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Andar wale hisse me aik ghongay, yani snail, ki shakal ki cheez hai jise cochlea kehte hain. Is ke andar pani bhara hai aur bareek baal jaisi cheezain hain. Awaaz ki lehrein is pani ko hilati hain aur wahan se khabar dimaagh ko jati hai, tab hum sunte hain. Isi andar wale hisse ke sath teen gol ghumti hui naliyan bhi hain jo hamare tawazun, yani balance, ko sambhalti hain. Isi liye kaan ki sakht bimari me insaan ko chakkar ate hain — sunne aur tawazun ka nizam aik hi ghar me rehta hai."),
      LessonBlock.visual("Kaan ke teen hisse alag alag rang me dikhayen — bahar wali nali aur parda, darmiyan me teen chhoti haddiyan (stapes par khaas nishan aur label ke ye jism ki sab se chhoti haddi hai), aur andar ghongay ki shakal wala cochlea. Awaaz ki lehrein teeron se bahar se andar jati hui dikhayen."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Haddiyan — jism ka dhancha"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Agar jism se haddiyan nikal di jayen to insaan gosht ka aik dheela thela ban kar reh jaye, bilkul us imarat ki tarah jis ka lohe ka dhancha nikal diya gaya ho. Haddiyan jism ko shakal deti hain, khara rakhti hain, aur andar ke nazuk hisso ki hifazat karti hain. Khopdi dimaagh ke gird aik mazboot helmet hai, aur pasliyan dil aur phuphron ke gird aik pinjra."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab tadaad wale do number pakke kar lo, kyunke paper inhi par ghoomta hai. Aik baligh insaan ke jism me 206 haddiyan hoti hain. Lekin paida hone wale bache ke jism me takreeban 300 haddiyan hoti hain. Ye farq kesay? Bache ki bohat si haddiyan naram hoti hain aur umar ke sath apas me jur kar aik ban jati hain. Is liye bade hote hote tadaad ghat kar 206 reh jati hai. Sawal me agar bacha likha ho to jawab 300, baligh likha ho to 206 — yahi bareeki paper pakarta hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Sab se lambi aur sab se mazboot haddi raan ki haddi hai, jise femur kehte hain. Ye ghutne se koolhay tak jati hai aur poore jism ka wazan uthaye rakhti hai. Aur pasliyan? Pasliyon ke 12 joray hote hain, yani kul 24 pasliyan, jo seene ke pinjre ko banati hain. Jahan do haddiyan milti hain usay jor, yani joint, kehte hain — ghutna, kohni aur ungliyan inhi joron ki wajah se murti hain. Aur aik baat jo aksar bhool jati hai: haddi andar se khokhli si hoti hai aur us khokhli jagah me aik naram cheez hai jise bone marrow kehte hain. Wahi hamara naya khoon, khaas kar ke lal khaliye, banati hai. Yani khoon banta haddiyon ke andar hai."),
      LessonBlock.visual("Poore insani dhanche ki tasveer ho jis me raan ki haddi femur ko khaas rang se numayan karke label lagaya jaye ke ye sab se lambi haddi hai. Seene ke pinjre par pasliyon ka label ho, khopdi par label ho, aur aik chhoti alag tasveer me haddi ko kaat kar andar ka bone marrow dikhaya jaye."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Dimaagh — jism ka control room"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Dimaagh khopdi ke andar rakha aik naram sa uzu hai, takreeban derh kilo ke qareeb. Is ki shakal dekhne me aik bare akhrot jaisi hai — upar se jhurriyon wala, gulabi aur sarmai rang ka, aur beech se aik gehri lakeer isay dayein aur bayein do hisso me baanti hai. Ye jhurriyan bewajah nahi. Dimaagh ki upar wali satah jitni zyada ho, utni zyada sochne ki taqat. Jhurriyon ne is satah ko khopdi ke chhote se khane me sama kar kayi guna barha diya hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Dimaagh ke teen bare hisse hain. Sab se bara hissa cerebrum hai — ye upar wala bara gumbad sa hissa hai, aur yahi hamari soch, yadasht, seekhne, bolne aur faisla karne ka markaz hai. Tum is waqt jo parh rahe ho, wo cerebrum hi samajh raha hai. Dusra hissa peeche neeche ki taraf chhota sa gol hissa hai jise cerebellum kehte hain. Ye jism ka tawazun aur harkaton ki hamahangi sambhalta hai — cycle chalate hue girne na dena isi ka kaam hai. Teesra hissa neeche aik dandi ki shakal me reedh ki haddi se jurta hai, ye saans aur dil ki dharkan jaisi khudkar cheezain chalata hai, jinhe hamein soch kar nahi karna parta."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper ke liye pakka kar lo: dimaagh ka sab se bara hissa cerebrum hai, aur sochne aur yadasht ka kaam isi ka hai. Dimaagh poore jism ko taaron ke aik jaal se control karta hai jinhe aasab, yani nerves, kehte hain. Ye taarain jism ke har hisse se khabar laati hain aur dimaagh ka hukam le jati hain."),
      LessonBlock.visual("Dimaagh ko side se dikhaya jaye — upar bara cerebrum, peeche neeche chhota cerebellum, aur neeche dandi jaisa brain stem. Teeno par label hon, aur cerebrum ko sab se numayan rang diya jaye ke ye sab se bara hissa hai aur soch yahin hoti hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Paachan ka nizam — khana se taqat tak"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Jo khana hum khate hain wo jism me aik lambe safar par nikalta hai. Ye safar aik nali hai jo munh se shuru ho kar takreeban 9 metre lambi hai, aur is safar me khana tukron me tutta, ghulta aur khoon me shamil hota rehta hai. Aao is safar par chalte hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Safar munh se shuru hota hai. Daant khane ko chabate hain aur zuban par maujood thook usay naram karta hai. Hazam asal me yahin se shuru ho jata hai. Phir khana aik nali se utar kar maiday me jata hai. Maida pait ke upar bayein taraf aik theli jaisa uzu hai jo phailta aur sikurta hai. Is me aik tezabi pani hota hai jo khane ko aur torta hai aur us me ghule jaraseem ko marta hai. Maiday me khana ghul mil kar aik garhay se pani jaisa ban jata hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Phir ye chhoti aant me jata hai, aur yahi hazam ki asal jagah hai. Chhoti aant naam ki chhoti hai, lekin ye takreeban 6 metre lambi hai aur kundli maar kar pait me pari hai. Yahin khana mukammal tor par hazam hota hai aur yahin se khane ki taqat aur ghizaiyat khoon me shamil hoti hai. Jo bach jata hai wo bari aant me jata hai, wahan se us ka pani jazb hota hai aur bacha khucha fazla ban jata hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Is nizam ke do bare madadgar khaas taur par samajh lo. Pehla jigar, yani liver. Ye pait ke upar dayein taraf rakha aik bara, gehra lal bhoora uzu hai, aur ye jism ke andar ka sab se bara ghudood hai. Jigar aik poori factory hai — ye khoon ko saaf karta hai, zehreli cheezon ko khatam karta hai, aur aik hariyal sa pani banata hai jise bile kehte hain jo charbi ko hazam karne me madad deta hai. Dusre gurday. Pait ke peeche, reedh ki haddi ke dono taraf, do lobiye ki shakal ke uzu hain. Gurday khoon ko chaante hain. Khoon in me se guzarta hai, gurday fazla aur zyada pani alag kar lete hain, aur wahi peshab ban jata hai. Gurday ke andar lakhon chhoti chhoti chhanniyan hain jinhe nephron kehte hain — khoon saaf karne ki asal ikai yehi nephron hai. Paper me sawal ata hai ke khoon saaf karne wala uzu konsa hai, aur gurday ke andar ki ikai ko kya kehte hain. Jawab: gurda, aur ikai nephron."),
      LessonBlock.visual("Aik jism ki tasveer me poora paachan ka rasta teer se dikhaya jaye — munh, khane ki nali, maida, chhoti aant, bari aant — aur sath me jigar aur dono gurday alag rang me numayan hon. Har hisse par label ho, aur gurday ki aik chhoti bari tasveer me nephron dikhaya jaye."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Chamra — jism ki deewar"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Chamre ko hum bas jism ki upar wali teh samajhte hain, lekin chamra asal me jism ka sab se bara uzu hai. Aik baligh insaan ki chamri phailai jaye to ye takreeban 2 metre murabba jagah gher legi aur wazan me 4 kilo ke qareeb hogi. Ye jism ko bahar ki dhool, jaraseem aur dhoop se bachati hai, jism ka darja hararat barqarar rakhti hai aur paseena nikal kar jism ko thanda karti hai. Chhoone ka ehsas bhi chamri hi deti hai — garam, thanda, dard, sab ki khabar yahin se dimaagh ko jati hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Chamri ki teen teh hain. Sab se upar wali bareek teh wo hai jo hum dekhte hain, usi me wo rang banane wali cheez hai jis se kisi ki rangat saaf aur kisi ki gehri hoti hai. Darmiyan wali teh me paseene ke ghudood, baalon ki jarein aur khoon ki bareek naliyan hain. Sab se neeche wali teh me charbi hoti hai jo jism ko narmi aur sardi se hifazat deti hai. Paper me chamre par sawal aik hi ghumta hai aur wo pakka hai: insani jism ka sab se bara uzu konsa hai? Jawab chamra hai, jigar nahi. Jigar sab se bara andar ka ghudood hai, lekin sab se bara uzu chamra hai — ye farq paper ka pasandida phanda hai."),
      LessonBlock.visual("Chamri ko side se kaat kar teeno tehain alag rang me dikhayi jayen — upar wali teh, darmiyan wali teh (jis me baal ki jar, paseene ka ghudood aur khoon ki nali nazar aye) aur neeche charbi wali teh. Har teh par label ho."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Sans ka nizam — hawa ka ana jana"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Har saans ke sath hum hawa andar lete hain, us hawa se oxygen nikal kar khoon me jati hai, aur jism ki gandi gas, carbon dioxide, bahar nikal jati hai. Ye tabadla phuphron me hota hai. Phuphre seene ke andar, dil ke dono taraf rakhe do naram, sponge jaisi shakal ke uzu hain. Ye andar se khokhle nahi hote, balke lakhon karoron chhoti chhoti hawa ki theliyon se bhare hote hain, bilkul sponge ke surakhon ki tarah. Hawa naak se andar ja kar aik nali se utarti hai, phir ye nali do hisso me bat kar dono phuphron me jati hai, aur andar ja kar chhoti chhoti shakhon me taqseem hoti rehti hai, bilkul darakht ki shakhon ki tarah, yahan tak ke un chhoti theliyon tak pohnchti hai jahan oxygen khoon me aur carbon dioxide khoon se hawa me tabdeel ho jati hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Is poore nizam ka asal mazdoor diaphragm hai. Ye phuphron ke bilkul neeche aik gumbad ki shakal ka patha hai. Jab ye neeche ki taraf khichta hai to seena phailta hai aur hawa andar bhar jati hai. Jab ye dhela parta hai to hawa bahar nikal jati hai. Yani hum asal me pet ke is pathay se saans lete hain. Paper ke liye teen baatein pakki kar lo: hum hawa se oxygen lete hain aur carbon dioxide bahar nikalte hain, ye tabadla phuphron me hota hai, aur saans ki harkat ka asal patha diaphragm hai."),
      LessonBlock.visual("Seene ki tasveer me dono phuphre sponge jaisi banawat ke sath dikhayen, beech se utarti hawa ki nali do shakhon me bat ti hui, aur phuphron ke neeche gumbad ki shakal ka diaphragm khaas rang me. Teeron se dikhaya jaye ke oxygen andar jati hai aur carbon dioxide bahar ati hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Aakhir me fix facts aik nazar me"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab wo saari baatein jo paper me bar bar dohrayi jati hain, aik jagah jama kar lo. Dil me chaar khane hote hain, dharkan aik minute me 72 dafa. Khoon aik baligh jism me takreeban 5 litre hota hai, us ka lal rang hemoglobin ki wajah se hai, aur khoon banta hai haddiyon ke bone marrow me. Universal donor O negative hai, universal recipient AB positive. Retina par aks ulta banta hai. Jism ki sab se chhoti haddi stapes kaan me hai, sab se lambi haddi femur raan me hai. Baligh me 206 haddiyan, bache me takreeban 300, pasliyon ke 12 joray. Dimaagh ka sab se bara hissa cerebrum hai. Jigar andar ka sab se bara ghudood hai, chamra sab se bara uzu hai. Gurda khoon saaf karta hai aur us ki ikai nephron hai. Hazam mukammal chhoti aant me hota hai. Saans ka asal patha diaphragm hai. In lines ko ratta mat lagao — har line ke peeche jo tasveer hum ne banayi hai usay zehen me lao, jawab khud ayega."),
    ],
  ),
  GeoTopic(
    id: "health-food",
    title: "Khurak, Vitamins aur Bimariyan",
    subtitle: "Jo khana tum khate ho wo jism ko kya deta hai, aur kami ho to kya hota hai",
    portion: "eds",
    blocks: <LessonBlock>[
      LessonBlock.heading("Ye lesson kyun zaroori hai"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Everyday Science me khurak aur sehat par har saal sawal ata hai. Konsa vitamin aankhon ke liye hai, scurvy kis vitamin ki kami se hoti hai, dengue konsa machhar phailata hai, antibiotic virus par kyun kaam nahi karta — ye sab paper ke fix sawal hain. Lekin student inhe ratta laga kar bhool jata hai, kyunke vitamin naam ki cheez na us ne dekhi hai, na wo janta hai ke ye asal me hota kya hai aur milta kahan se hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Is lesson me hum har vitamin ko us ke khane ke sath jor kar dekhen ge. Jab tum zehen me gajar dekho ge to vitamin A yaad ayega, malta dekho ge to vitamin C. Phir bimariyon ko samjhen ge — pehle ye ke bacteria aur virus me farq kya hai, kyunke aadhe sawal wahi se bante hain. Tasveer zehen me hogi to paper me naam dekh kar jawab khud nikal ayega."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Vitamin kya hai, pehle ye samajh lo"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Khana jism ko do tarah ki cheezain deta hai. Aik wo jo taqat deti hain aur jism banati hain — roti, chaawal, gosht, daal. Dusri wo bareek cheezain jo miqdar me bohat kam chahiye lekin un ke baghair jism ki machine sahi chalti nahi. Inhi bareek cheezon ko vitamin kehte hain. Inhe angrezi ke hurf se naam mile hain — A, B, C, D, E, K. Har vitamin ka apna aik khaas kaam hai, aur jis vitamin ki kami ho, usi kaam wali jagah par bimari nazar ati hai. Ye usool yaad rakho: kami wahi takleef degi jahan kaam us vitamin ka tha."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Vitamin A — aankhon wala vitamin"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Zehen me gajar lao. Wahi lambi, nargisi rang ki gajar. Vitamin A ka sab se mashhoor zariya yehi hai. Is ke ilawa anday ki zardi, doodh, makhan, kaleji aur hare patton wali sabziyan is se bhari hain. Vitamin A ka asal kaam aankhon se hai. Ye roshni ko mehsoos karne wali taqat ko barqarar rakhta hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Is ki kami se sab se pehle jo bimari hoti hai wo hai shab-kori, jisay angrezi me night blindness kehte hain. Shab-kori ka matlab hai ke banday ko din me to nazar ata hai, lekin sham hote hi, kam roshni me, usay dikhai dena band ho jata hai. Socho, jese hi andhera hua, aankh andhi. Agar kami aur barh jaye to aankhain khushk ho kar asal me kharab bhi ho sakti hain, aur yehi vitamin ki kami duniya me bachon ke andhe hone ki bari wajah hai. Paper me sawal yun ata hai — raat ko nazar na ana kis vitamin ki kami hai? Jawab vitamin A. Sath ye bhi pakka kar lo ke vitamin A chamri aur jism ki jaraseem se larne wali taqat ke liye bhi zaroori hai."),
      LessonBlock.visual("Aik meiz par gajar, anda, doodh ka glass aur hari sabziyan dikhayi jayen, un ke upar vitamin A ka label ho, aur sath me aik aankh ki tasveer ho jis ke aadhe hisse par din ki roshni aur aadhe par andhera dikhaya jaye taake shab-kori ka matlab aik nazar me samajh aye."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Vitamin B group — taqat aur aasab wala khandaaan"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Vitamin B aik akela vitamin nahi, ye poora khandaan hai. Is khandaan ke bohat se afraad hain, is liye inhe B complex kehte hain. Ye gandum, chaawal ke chilke, daalon, anday, gosht aur doodh me milte hain. In ka kaam khane ko taqat me badalne me madad karna aur aasab, yani nerves, ko sahi rakhna hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Is khandaan ka sab se mashhoor banda vitamin B1 hai, kyunke paper isi par phansta hai. B1 ki kami se beriberi naam ki bimari hoti hai. Beriberi me taangain kamzor ho jati hain, sun si ho jati hain aur jism phoolne lagta hai. Ye bimari purane zamane me un ilaqon me bohat hui jahan log sirf safaid polish wale chaawal khate the, kyunke chaawal ki polish ke sath us ka chilka utar jata tha aur chilke me hi B1 hota tha. Kahani samajh aa gayi to fact nahi bhoole ga: chilka gaya, vitamin gaya, beriberi ayi. Paper me sawal seedha ata hai — beriberi kis vitamin ki kami se hoti hai? Jawab B1."),
      LessonBlock.visual("Do chaawalon ki tasveer sath sath ho — aik chilke wala bhoora chaawal, aik chamakta safaid polish wala — aur safaid chaawal ke neeche nishan ho ke polish me B1 nikal gaya. Sath me B1 aur beriberi ka label wali aik taang ki tasveer."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Vitamin C — zakham bharne wala, malte wala vitamin"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab zehen me malta lao, nimbu lao, amla lao. Jo bhi khatti cheez hai, us me vitamin C hai. Amla in sab ka sardar hai, is me malte se kayi guna zyada vitamin C hota hai. Is ke ilawa amrood, tamatar aur hari mirch bhi ache zariye hain. Vitamin C ka kaam jism ke jorne wale hisse ko mazboot rakhna hai — chamri, masoorhe, khoon ki naliyan. Ye zakham bharne me madad karta hai aur jaraseem se larne wali taqat ko bhi barhata hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Is ki kami se scurvy hoti hai, aur scurvy ki pehchan bari wazeh hai — masoorhon se khoon ana. Daant dhote hue masoorhe khoon dene lagte hain, daant hilne lagte hain, purane zakham dobara khul jate hain. Purane zamane me ye samandari jahazon ke malahon ki bimari thi. Maheeno samandar me rehne walon ko taza phal sabzi nahi milti thi, to un ke masoorhe khoon dene lagte the. Phir pata chala ke nimbu khilane se ye theek ho jati hai. Paper me sawal bilkul yun banta hai — masoorhon se khoon ana aur scurvy kis vitamin ki kami hai? Jawab vitamin C. Aik bareeki aur: vitamin C pani me ghul jata hai aur garam karne se kharab ho jata hai, is liye ye roz khana parta hai, jism isay jama nahi rakhta."),
      LessonBlock.visual("Malta, nimbu, amla aur amrood aik sath dikhayen, un par vitamin C ka label ho. Sath me masoorhe ki aik saaf tasveer ho jis me khoon ane wali jagah par nishan ho taake scurvy ki pehchan zehen me beth jaye."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Vitamin D — sooraj ki roshni wala vitamin"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ye vitamin sab se alag hai, kyunke ye sirf khane se nahi milta. Jab sooraj ki roshni hamari chamri par parti hai to jism khud vitamin D banata hai. Isi liye isay sooraj ki roshni wala vitamin kehte hain. Khane me ye anday ki zardi, machli aur doodh me milta hai. Vitamin D ka asal kaam haddiyon se hai. Ye khane me maujood calcium ko jism me jazb karne me madad karta hai. Calcium ho lekin vitamin D na ho to calcium haddiyon tak pohnchta hi nahi."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Is ki kami se bachon me rickets hoti hai. Rickets me bache ki taang ki haddiyan naram reh jati hain aur jism ke wazan se terhi ho jati hain — taangain bahar ki taraf mur jati hain, bilkul kaman ki tarah. Tasveer zehen me bana lo: naram haddi, upar jism ka wazan, haddi jhuk gayi. Badon me bhi is ki kami se haddiyan naram aur kamzor ho jati hain. Paper ke do sawal fix hain — konsa vitamin sooraj ki roshni se banta hai, aur rickets kis vitamin ki kami hai. Dono ka jawab vitamin D hai."),
      LessonBlock.visual("Aik taraf chamri par parti sooraj ki kirnain dikhayi jayen jin se vitamin D banta hua dikhe, dusri taraf aik bache ki terhi taangon wali tasveer ho jis par rickets ka label ho. Dono tasveeron ko teer se jora jaye taake kami aur bimari ka rishta saaf nazar aye."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Vitamin E aur Vitamin K — do chhote lekin lazmi naam"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Vitamin E jism ke khaliyon ko kharab hone se bachata hai aur chamri aur tolidi sehat ke liye zaroori hai. Ye sabzi ke telon, giri dar mevon, anday aur hare patton wali sabziyon me milta hai. Is ki kami bohat kam hoti hai, is liye paper me ye kam ata hai, bas naam aur kaam yaad kar lo."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Vitamin K ka kaam sirf aik hai, lekin wo aik kaam zindagi bachata hai — khoon ko jamana. Pichle lesson me hum ne parha tha ke platelets khoon jamaate hain, un ki madad yehi vitamin karta hai. Is ki kami ho to chot par khoon behta rehta hai, rukta nahi. Ye hari sabziyon me milta hai, aur hamari aanton me rehne wale ache jaraseem bhi isay banate hain. Paper me sawal ata hai — khoon ke jamne ke liye konsa vitamin zaroori hai? Jawab vitamin K. K ko khoon ke jamne, yani clotting, ke sath jor kar yaad rakho."),
      LessonBlock.visual("Aik ungli par chhota sa zakham dikhaya jaye jis par khoon jam kar ruk gaya ho, aur jamne wali jagah par vitamin K ka label ho. Sath me hari sabziyon ki chhoti tasveer ho."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Minerals — haddi, khoon aur gale ke teen naam"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Vitamins ke ilawa khane se kuch aur bareek cheezain milti hain jinhe minerals kehte hain. In me se teen paper ke sardar hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pehla calcium. Zehen me doodh ka glass lao, dahi lao, paneer lao. Calcium haddiyon aur daanton ki asal cheez hai — haddi asal me calcium ka dhancha hai. Is ki kami se haddiyan kamzor aur bhurbhuri ho jati hain, badon me zara si chot se toot jati hain. Yahan pichli baat jor lo: calcium akele kaam nahi karta, usay haddi tak pohnchane wala vitamin D hai. Dono ka jora paper me sath sath ata hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Dusra iron, yani loha. Is ka kaam khoon se hai. Pichle lesson me hum ne hemoglobin parha tha — wahi jo oxygen le jata hai, wo iron ke baghair banta hi nahi. Iron ki kami se khoon kam ho jata hai, is halat ko anemia kehte hain. Anemia wale banday ka rang peela par jata hai, thakan rehti hai, saans phoolta hai, kyunke khoon me oxygen le jane wale hi kam reh gaye. Iron gosht, kaleji, anday, daalon aur palak jaisi hari sabziyon me milta hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Teesra iodine. Ye miqdar me sab se kam chahiye, lekin is ki kami sab se zyada nazar ati hai. Iodine gale me maujood aik ghudood ke liye zaroori hai. Is ki kami se wo ghudood phool jata hai aur gale ke samne aik gilti si ban jati hai — isay goiter, Urdu me galgand, kehte hain. Pahari ilaqon me jahan ki mitti aur pani me iodine kam hoti hai, ye bimari aam thi. Isi liye aaj kal namak me iodine milaya jata hai. Zehen me tasveer bana lo: namak ki theli par likha \"iodized\" aur gale ki pholi hui gilti — dono aik hi kahani ke do siray hain. Paper me sawal ata hai — goiter kis cheez ki kami se hota hai? Jawab iodine."),
      LessonBlock.visual("Teen khane alag alag dikhayen — doodh ke sath haddi ki tasveer aur calcium ka label, palak aur kaleji ke sath khoon ki nali aur iron ka label, aur iodized namak ki theli ke sath gale ki tasveer aur iodine ka label. Har khane ko us ke kaam wale hisse se teer jora jaye."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Ab bimariyan — pehle bacteria aur virus ka farq"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Bimariyon ki list se pehle wo farq samajh lo jis par aadha paper khara hai: bacteria aur virus me farq kya hai?"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Bacteria aik zinda cheez hai. Ye aik khaliye wali nihayat chhoti makhlooq hai — itni chhoti ke aam aankh se nazar nahi ati, lekin zinda hai, khati hai, barhti hai aur apni taqat par jism se bahar bhi zinda reh sakti hai. Virus us se bhi chhota hai, aur asal farq ye hai ke virus apne tor par zinda cheez nahi hai. Ye jism ke zinda khaliye ke andar ghus kar hi barh sakta hai, bahar ye aik bejaan tukra para rehta hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab paper ka sab se pyara phanda sun lo. Antibiotic dawai bacteria ko marti hai, lekin virus par antibiotic ka koi asar nahi hota. Kyun? Kyunke antibiotic bacteria ki zindagi wali cheezon ko torta hai, aur virus me wo zindagi wali cheezain hoti hi nahi — wo to kisi aur ke khaliye me chhupa hota hai. Isi liye aam zukam aur flu, jo virus se hote hain, antibiotic se theek nahi hote, aur doctor bila wajah antibiotic nahi deta. Sawal paper me bilkul yun ata hai — antibiotic kis par asar nahi karti? Jawab virus. Ye line pakki kar lo, phir har bimari ko is farq se tolna asaan ho jayega."),
      LessonBlock.visual("Do tasveerain sath sath hon — aik taraf gol aur dandi jaisi shaklon wale bacteria jo apne tor par khare dikhaye jayen, dusri taraf us se bhi chhota virus jo aik jism ke khaliye ke andar ghusta hua dikhaya jaye. Beech me aik dawai ki goli dikhayi jaye jo bacteria par to cross lagaye lekin virus par sawal ka nishan ho."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Mashhoor bimariyan aur un ki wajah"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab har bimari ko us ki pehchan ke sath yaad karte hain — wajah kya hai, phailti kesay hai, aur paper us me se kya poochta hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("TB, yani tap-e-diq. Ye bacteria se hoti hai. Ye aam tor par phuphron ko kharab karti hai. Lambi khansi, wazan ghatna, sham ko halka bukhar — ye is ki nishaniyan hain. Ye mareez ke khansne se hawa ke zariye phailti hai. Paper me sawal: TB kis se hoti hai? Jawab bacteria."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Polio. Ye virus se hoti hai aur chhote bachon par hamla karti hai. Ye aasab ko kharab kar ke taang ya bazu ko hamesha ke liye kamzor ya mazoor kar deti hai. Is se bachao ke qatray bachon ko pilaye jate hain — polio ke qatray asal me vaccine hai jo munh se di jati hai. Pakistan me polio ke khatme ki muhim isi liye chalti hai. Paper me: polio virus se hoti hai, aur qatray vaccine hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Dengue. Ye virus se hoti hai lekin phailata machhar hai — Aedes naam ka machhar, jo saaf khare pani me palta hai aur din ke waqt kaatta hai. Dengue me tez bukhar hota hai aur khoon ke platelets girne lagte hain. Yaad hai platelets khoon jamaate hain? Wahi girte hain, is liye dengue khatarnak ho sakta hai. Paper ke do fix nukta: dengue virus hai, aur phailane wala machhar Aedes hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Malaria. Ye na bacteria hai na virus — ye Plasmodium naam ke aik chhote parasite se hota hai, aur isay phailata hai Anopheles machhar ki mada. Malaria me bukhar kaanp kaanp kar charhta hai aur paseena aa kar utar jata hai, ye silsila har dusre teesre din dohraya jata hai. Purane zamane se is ki dawai quinine hai, jo aik darakht ki chaal se banti thi. Yahan wo farq pakka kar lo jo paper me sab ko phansta hai — dengue wala machhar Aedes hai, malaria wala Anopheles hai. Aur malaria ki wajah Plasmodium hai, machhar sirf usay le jane wala hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Hepatitis. Ye jigar ki bimari hai aur virus se hoti hai. Jigar kharab ho to aankhain aur chamri peeli parne lagti hai, is halat ko peelia bhi kehte hain. Is ki chand qismein hain — kuch gande pani aur khane se phailti hain, kuch khoon ke zariye. Paper me: hepatitis jigar ki bimari hai aur virus se hoti hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Rabies. Ye pagal kutte ke kaatne se hone wala virus hai. Ye dimaagh par hamla karta hai aur nishaniyan anay ke baad ye taqreeban hamesha jaan lewa hoti hai. Isi liye kutte ke kaatne par foran zakham dhona aur teekay lagwana lazmi hai — intezar nahi karna. Paper me: rabies virus hai aur kutte ke kaatne se hoti hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Cholera, Urdu me haiza. Ye bacteria se hoti hai aur gande pani se phailti hai. Is me shadeed dast lagte hain aur jism se pani itni tezi se nikalta hai ke banda ghanton me kamzor ho jata hai. Is ka ilaj asal me khoya hua pani wapas dena hai — ORS wala ghol isiliye diya jata hai. Paper me: cholera bacteria hai, zariya ganda pani."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Typhoid. Ye bhi bacteria se hota hai aur gande pani aur khane se phailta hai. Is me bukhar ahista ahista barhta hai aur kayi din rehta hai. Paper me cholera aur typhoid aksar sath rakh kar pooche jate hain — dono bacteria, dono gande pani se."),
      LessonBlock.visual("Do machharon ki alag alag tasveerain hon — Aedes par dengue ka label, Anopheles par malaria ka label — taake dono ka farq tasveer se zehen me beth jaye. Sath me aik chhoti list ki jagah har bimari ke sath us ki wajah wala chhota nishan ho: TB bacteria, polio virus, hepatitis virus aur jigar, rabies kutta, cholera ganda pani."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Vaccine kya hai aur kaam kesay karti hai"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Polio ke qatray, bachpan ke teekay — ye sab vaccine hai. Lekin vaccine hoti kya hai, ye samajh lo to aadhe sawal wahi hal ho jayen ge."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Zehen me aik sipahion ki fauj ki tasveer banao jo asal jang se pehle mashq karti hai. Vaccine jism ke liye wahi mashq hai. Vaccine me asal bimari ke jaraseem ko kamzor kar ke, ya maar kar, jism me dala jata hai. Ye kamzor jaraseem bimari nahi kar sakte, lekin jism ke sipahi, yani WBC, inhe dekh kar pehchan lete hain aur in se larne ka tareeqa seekh lete hain. Phir jab asal taqatwar jaraseem kabhi hamla kare to sipahi pehle se tayyar hote hain — pehchan bhi mojood, larai ka tareeqa bhi. Bimari honay se pehle hi khatam ho jati hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Yahi wajah hai ke vaccine bimari honay se PEHLE lagayi jati hai, ilaj ke tor par nahi, bachao ke tor par. Aur ye bhi samajh lo ke vaccine virus wali bimariyon se bhi bachati hai, jahan antibiotic bekaar tha — kyunke ye dawai nahi, jism ki apni tayyari hai. Paper me sawal ata hai — vaccine ka kaam kya hai? Jawab: jism me bimari se pehle hi us se larne ki taqat, yani immunity, paida karna."),
      LessonBlock.visual("Aik chhoti kahani wali tasveer teen hisso me ho — pehle kamzor jaraseem jism me jata hua, phir safed khaliye sipahi usay dekh kar seekhte hue, aur aakhir me asal jaraseem ke hamle par wahi sipahi foran usay khatam karte hue. Har hisse par aik chhota label ho."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Aakhir me safai — sab se sasti dawai"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Itni saari bimariyon ke baad aik baat ghor se sun lo. Cholera, typhoid, hepatitis ki kuch qismein, polio — ye sab munh se jism me jati hain, aur munh tak pohnchne ka sab se aam rasta hamare haath hain. Haath din bhar har cheez ko chhoote hain, jaraseem haathon par lagte hain, aur khana khate waqt wahi haath munh ko lagte hain. Khane se pehle aur washroom ke baad sabun se haath dhona is poori zanjeer ko beech se kaat deta hai. Saaf pani peena dusri deewar hai, kyunke ganda pani aadhi bimariyon ka rasta hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper me sawal ghum kar ata hai — konsi bimariyan gande pani se phailti hain? Ab tum list ratte baghair nikaal sakte ho: cholera, typhoid, hepatitis ki pani wali qismein, polio. Tasveer wahi hai — ganda pani, us me jaraseem, aur munh tak ka rasta. Rasta band kar do, bimari ruk jayegi."),
      LessonBlock.visual("Aik taraf gande pani ka glass jaraseem ke nishanon ke sath dikhaya jaye, dusri taraf sabun se haath dhota hua banda, aur beech me aik kati hui zanjeer ka nishan ho jo dikhaye ke safai ne bimari ka rasta kaat diya."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Aakhir me fix facts aik nazar me"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab wo baatein jo paper me dohrayi jati hain, aik jagah jama kar lo. Vitamin A aankhon ke liye, kami se shab-kori. B1 ki kami se beriberi. Vitamin C ki kami se scurvy aur masoorhon se khoon. Vitamin D sooraj se banta hai, kami se rickets. Vitamin K khoon jamaata hai. Calcium haddi aur daant, iron khoon aur hemoglobin, iodine ki kami se goiter. Antibiotic virus par asar nahi karti. TB aur cholera aur typhoid bacteria se. Polio, dengue, hepatitis aur rabies virus se. Dengue Aedes machhar se, malaria Anopheles machhar se aur us ki wajah Plasmodium hai. Dengue me platelets girte hain. Vaccine bimari se pehle jism me immunity banati hai. In me se har line ke peeche jo tasveer hum ne banayi hai, usay zehen me lao — jawab ratta nahi marega, tasveer bole gi."),
    ],
  ),
  GeoTopic(
    id: "plants-nature",
    title: "Pauday aur Qudrat",
    subtitle: "Roz dikhne wali cheezain, jo asal me hain kya",
    portion: "eds",
    blocks: <LessonBlock>[
      LessonBlock.heading("Ye hissa kyun zaroori hai"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Everyday Science ke paper me sab se zyada sawal unhi cheezon par bante hain jo hum roz dekhte hain. Phool har gali me khilta hai, barish har saal hoti hai, baadal roz asmaan par tehalte hain, lekin jab paper poochta hai ke phool ka nar hissa konsa hai, ya chamak pehle kyun dikhti hai aur garaj baad me kyun sunai deti hai, to aksar student ruk jata hai. Wajah ye nahi ke ye cheezain mushkil hain. Wajah ye hai ke hum ne inhe kabhi ghoor se dekha hi nahi. Is hisse me hum har cheez ko pehle alfaaz se tumhari ankhon ke samne khada karenge. Cheez dikhti kaisi hai, us ke hisse konsay hain, phir wo kaam kesay karti hai, aur aakhir me paper wala sawal. Jab tasveer zehen me ban jayegi, to jawab khud yaad rahega, ratta lagane ki zaroorat hi nahi paregi."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Phool ke hisse, ankh se dekho"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Sab se pehle aik khila hua phool apne zehen me lao. Gulab ya genda ka phool samne rakho. Sab se bahar jo rang barang bare bare hisse nazar ate hain, jin ki wajah se phool khubsurat dikhta hai, unhe pankhariyan kehte hain, English me petals. Pankhariyon ka kaam sirf khubsurti nahi hai. Ye door se keeron ko bulati hain, bilkul jese dukaan ka board grahak ko bulata hai. Pankhariyon ke neeche, phool ke bilkul buniyadi hisse me chhoti sabz pattiyon jaisi cheezain hoti hain, unhe sepal kehte hain. Jab phool kali hota hai, yehi sabz hisse use lapait kar hifazat karte hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab phool ke darmiyan me dekho. Darmiyan se chand patli patli salaiyan si nikli hoti hain jin ke siro par chhoti si gathri ya theli bani hoti hai. Ye phool ka nar hissa hai, isay stamen kehte hain. Us theli ko anther kehte hain aur us ke andar peelay rang ka bareek powder bhara hota hai, jisay pollen kehte hain. Pollen hi asal me nar khulye hain, bilkul beej jaisi chhoti si cheez, lekin itni chhoti ke powder lagti hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Phool ke bilkul beech me, sab se darmiyan, aik surahi ya bottle jaisi saakht khadi hoti hai. Ye phool ka mada hissa hai, isay pistil ya carpel kehte hain. Is ke teen hisse gaur se dekho. Sab se neeche phula hua hissa ovary hai, us ke andar chhote chhote daanay hain jinhe ovule kehte hain, yehi aage chal kar beej bante hain. Ovary ke upar patli si naali hai jisay style kehte hain, aur naali ke sab se upar chipchipa sa sira hai jisay stigma kehte hain. Pollen ko isi stigma par girna hota hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab asal kahani suno. Nar hisse ka pollen mada hisse ke stigma tak kesay pohanchta hai? Is safar ko pollination kehte hain. Kabhi ye kaam hawa karti hai, pollen halka hota hai, hawa use ura kar dusre phool tak le jati hai, ghaas aur anaaj ke phool aksar aise hi hote hain. Lekin rang barang bare phoolon ka kaam keere karte hain. Shehad ki makkhi ya titli phool ka meetha ras peene ati hai, us ke jism par pollen chipak jata hai, aur jab wo dusre phool par jati hai to pollen wahan ke stigma par gir jata hai. Isi liye phool rang barang aur khushbu daar hote hain, taake keere door se ayein. Pollen stigma par girne ke baad aik naali si ban kar ovary tak jata hai, ovule se milta hai, is milap ko fertilization kehte hain, aur is ke baad ovule beej ban jata hai aur ovary phal ban jati hai. Aam, seb aur tamatar jo tum khate ho, ye sab kisi zamane me kisi phool ki ovary the."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper yahan yun sawal banata hai. Phool ka nar hissa konsa hai, jawab stamen. Mada hissa konsa hai, jawab pistil. Pollen kahan banta hai, jawab anther me. Beej kis hisse se banta hai, jawab ovule se. Phal kis se banta hai, jawab ovary se."),
      LessonBlock.visual("App me phool ko beech se kaat kar aadha dikhaya jaye taake andar ke hisse nazar ayein. Pankhari, sepal, stamen ki theli (anther), pollen ke daanay, pistil ke teen hisse stigma, style aur ovary, har aik par us ke naam ka label lage. Aik taraf shehad ki makkhi phool par bethi dikhe jis ke jism par pollen chipka ho."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Photosynthesis, pauda khana kesay banata hai"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab pauday ki sab se bari khasiyat samjho, wo khasiyat jo kisi janwar ke paas nahi. Pauda apna khana khud banata hai. Tum khana bahar se khate ho, pauda khana apne patton ke andar tayyar karta hai. Is amal ko photosynthesis kehte hain. Photo matlab roshni, synthesis matlab banana, yani roshni se banana."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Tasveer zehen me banao. Aik sabz patta samne hai. Upar se sooraj ki kirnein patte par par rahi hain. Neeche zameen se jarein pani kheench kar tanay ke raste patte tak pohancha rahi hain. Hawa me aik gas hai jisay carbon dioxide kehte hain, jo hum saans chorne par bahar nikalte hain. Patte ki satah par chhote chhote suraakh hain, un se ye gas andar jati hai. Patte ke andar sabz rang ka aik khaas mada hai jisay chlorophyll kehte hain. Yehi sabz mada sooraj ki roshni ko pakarta hai, aur usi roshni ki taaqat se pani aur carbon dioxide ko jod kar cheeni jaisi cheez banata hai jisay glucose kehte hain. Yehi glucose pauday ka khana hai. Is amal me aik gas fazool nikalti hai, aur wo hai oxygen, jo patte se bahar hawa me mil jati hai. Wahi oxygen jo hum saans me lete hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Is poori baat ko alfaaz ki equation me yun likhte hain. Carbon dioxide aur pani, sooraj ki roshni aur chlorophyll ki maujoodgi me, glucose aur oxygen ban jate hain. Bas yehi aik line paper ka sab se mashhoor sawal hai. Pauda khana banane ke liye kya kya leta hai? Pani, carbon dioxide aur sooraj ki roshni. Aur kya kharij karta hai? Oxygen."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab aik bareek baat, jis par paper phansata hai. Pauday ka rang sabz kyun hai? Chlorophyll ki wajah se. Chlorophyll sooraj ki roshni ke baqi rang jazb kar leta hai lekin sabz rang ko wapas phenk deta hai, is liye patta sabz dikhta hai. Dusri bareeki ye hai ke photosynthesis sirf din ko hota hai, kyunke is ke liye roshni lazmi hai. Lekin saans lene ka amal, jisay respiration kehte hain, pauday me din raat har waqt jari rehta hai, bilkul hamari tarah. Is liye raat ko pauda oxygen nahi banata, balke thodi si carbon dioxide kharij karta hai. Yehi wajah hai ke purani hidayat me bade darakht ke neeche raat ko sone se mana kiya jata hai, halanke din ko wahi darakht oxygen ka karobar karta hai. Paper ka sawal yun banta hai. Din ke waqt pauda konsi gas kharij karta hai? Oxygen. Raat ko konsi? Carbon dioxide. Aur yaad rakho, din ko bhi pauda saans leta hai, lekin photosynthesis itna tez hota hai ke oxygen zyada banti hai aur wohi bahar ati hai."),
      LessonBlock.visual("Aik bada patta darmiyan me dikhe. Upar se sooraj aur us ki kirnon par \"roshni\" ka label, side se teer hawa ki taraf se andar jata hua jis par carbon dioxide likha ho, neeche jaron se pani ka teer upar ata hua, aur patte se bahar nikalta hua teer jis par oxygen likha ho. Patte ke andar chhote sabz daanay chlorophyll ke naam se dikhaye jayen."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Beej se pauda, germination ke marhalay"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab aik beej ko zameen me dabta hua dekho. Chane ya phali ka beej samne rakho, sakht sa, sookha sa, bejaan sa lagta hai. Lekin us ke andar aik chhota sa pauda soya hua hai aur sath us ke liye pehle dinon ka khana bhi rakha hai. Is soye hue pauday ke jag kar bahar ane ko germination kehte hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Marhalay tartib se samjho, paper tartib hi poochta hai. Pehla marhala, beej zameen se pani jazb karta hai aur phool jata hai, us ka sakht chilka narm par jata hai. Dusra marhala, beej ke andar se sab se pehle aik safed si cheez neeche ki taraf nikalti hai. Ye jarr hai, isay radicle kehte hain. Gaur karo, sab se pehle jarr nikalti hai, tana nahi, kyunke pauday ko sab se pehle pani aur sahara chahiye. Teesra marhala, phir upar ki taraf hari si konpal nikalti hai, isay plumule kehte hain, yehi aage chal kar tana aur patte banti hai. Beej ke do mote hisse jinhe cotyledon kehte hain, shuru ke dinon me is chhote pauday ko khana dete rehte hain, jab tak ke patte nikal kar khud khana banana na shuru kar dein."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Germination ke liye teen shartein lazmi hain, ye paper ka fix sawal hai. Pani, taake beej jaag jaye. Hawa, yani oxygen, taake beej saans le sake. Aur munasib garmi, na bohat zyada na bohat kam. Roshni shuru ke marhalay me lazmi nahi hoti, beej andhere me bhi nikal ata hai, yehi wo bareeki hai jis par ghalat jawab lagta hai."),
      LessonBlock.visual("Zameen ki lakeer ke neeche beej ke chaar marhalay aik ke baad aik dikhaye jayen. Pehle sookha beej, phir phula hua beej, phir neeche nikalti jarr (radicle) ka label, phir upar uthti konpal (plumule) ka label, aur beej ke khane wale hisse par cotyledon ka label lage."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Pani ka cycle, wahi pani bar bar"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab asmaan ki taraf dekho. Samandar, daria aur jheelon ka pani kahan jata hai aur barish ban kar kesay wapas ata hai? Ye aik gol chakkar hai jisay pani ka cycle ya water cycle kehte hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pehla qadam, sooraj ki garmi se samandar aur dariaon ka pani bhaap ban kar upar uthta hai. Is bhaap banne ko evaporation kehte hain. Gaur karo, yehi amal geele kapre sookhne me hota hai. Dusra qadam, upar thandi hawa me ye bhaap thandi ho kar dobara chhote chhote qatron me badal jati hai. Isay condensation kehte hain. Lakhon karoron qatray mil kar baadal ban jate hain. Aaina par bathroom me jo dhund jamti hai, wo bhi yehi condensation hai. Teesra qadam, jab qatray bare aur bhari ho jate hain to zameen ki kashish unhe neeche kheench leti hai, aur barish girti hai. Barish ko precipitation kehte hain, aur oolay aur barf bhi isi ki qismein hain. Chautha qadam, barish ka pani naalon aur dariaon se beh kar dobara samandar me ja girta hai, kuch zameen ke andar utar kar underground pani ban jata hai, aur phir sooraj use dobara bhaap bana deta hai. Chakkar yunhi chalta rehta hai, aur is poore chakkar ka engine sooraj hai. Paper poochta hai, pani ke cycle me pehla marhala konsa hai? Evaporation. Baadal kis amal se bante hain? Condensation se."),
      LessonBlock.visual("Aik gol chakkar ki shakal me diagram ho. Neeche samandar, upar uthti bhaap ke teer par evaporation, asmaan par baadal par condensation, barish ke qatron par precipitation, aur pahar se behta daria wapas samandar ki taraf jata hua dikhe. Side me sooraj bana ho jis par \"engine\" ki tarah garmi ka label lage."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Mausam aur hawa, baadal, barish aur garaj chamak"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Baadal asal me hain kya? Upar ja kar samjho. Zameen ke paas ki garam hawa halki hoti hai, wo upar uthti hai. Upar hawa thandi hai, garam hawa ki bhaap thandi ho kar chhote qatron me badal jati hai, yehi qatray baadal hain. Baadal asal me asmaan par tairti hui dhund hai. Jab tum pahar par jate ho aur baadal tumhare aas paas hota hai to wahi dhund hoti hai. Jab qatray itne bare ho jayen ke hawa unhe sambhal na sake, barish girti hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab garaj chamak wali baat, jo paper ka pasandida sawal hai. Toofani baadalon ke andar barq yani bijli paida hoti hai, aur jab wo chamakti hai to use chamak kehte hain, aur us ke phatne ki awaaz ko garaj. Tum ne dekha hoga, pehle chamak dikhti hai, phir chand second baad garaj sunai deti hai. Aisa kyun? Kyunke roshni ki raftaar bohat zyada hai, aik second me teen lakh kilometer, jabke awaaz ki raftaar aik second me sirf taqreeban 343 meter hai. Roshni takreeban foran tumhari ankh tak pohanch jati hai, awaaz ko ane me waqt lagta hai. Agar chamak ke teen second baad garaj sune to samjho toofan taqreeban aik kilometer door hai. Ye hisaab bhi paper me ata hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab rainbow, yani qaus-e-quzah. Barish ke baad jab sooraj nikalta hai aur tumhari peeth sooraj ki taraf ho, to samne asmaan par rangon ka aik bada sa aadha gol qaus ban jata hai. Wajah ye hai ke hawa me reh jane wale barish ke qatray chhote sheeshon ki tarah kaam karte hain. Sooraj ki safed roshni qatre ke andar ja kar apne saat rangon me bant jati hai. Saat rangon ki tartib yaad karne ka lafz hai VIBGYOR. Is ke har harf se rang nikalo. V se Violet yani banafshi, I se Indigo yani gehara neela, B se Blue yani neela, G se Green yani sabz, Y se Yellow yani peela, O se Orange yani narangi, R se Red yani lal. Qaus me sab se upar lal hota hai aur sab se neeche banafshi. Paper poochta hai, rainbow me kul kitne rang hote hain? Saat. Aur safed roshni ko rangon me bantne ko dispersion kehte hain."),
      LessonBlock.visual("Aik taraf sooraj, dusri taraf barish ke qatray, aur darmiyan me saat rangon ki patti bani hui qaus dikhe, har rang par us ke naam ka label tartib se lage. Neeche garaj chamak wali chhoti tasveer me baadal se chamak pehle aur awaaz ki lehrain baad me pohanchti hui dikhayi jayen."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Greenhouse effect aur global warming"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab aik kambal wali misaal se bari baat samjho. Sardion me tum kambal orhte ho to jism ki garmi andar ruk jati hai aur tum garam rehte ho. Zameen ke gird hawa ki teh bhi aisa hi kambal hai. Sooraj ki garmi zameen tak ati hai, lekin jab zameen use wapas khala ki taraf phenkti hai to hawa me mojood kuch gasain, khaas tor par carbon dioxide aur methane, us garmi ka kuch hissa rok leti hain. Is amal ko greenhouse effect kehte hain. Greenhouse asal me sheeshay ka wo ghar hota hai jo thande ilaqon me pauday ugane ke liye banaya jata hai, sheesha garmi andar rok leta hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Aik baat saaf samajh lo, greenhouse effect bura nahi hai. Agar ye bilkul na hota to zameen itni thandi ho jati ke zindagi mumkin na rehti. Masla tab banta hai jab hum koyla, petrol aur gas jala jala kar hawa me carbon dioxide bohat zyada kar dete hain. Kambal mota ho jata hai, garmi zyada rukti hai, aur zameen ka darja hararat ahista ahista barhne lagta hai. Isi ko global warming kehte hain. Is ke nateeje paper me yun ate hain. Glacier pighalte hain, samandar ki satah unchi hoti hai, mausam bigarte hain, kabhi shadeed garmi aur kabhi achanak barish. Paper ka sawal, global warming ki sab se bari wajah konsi gas hai? Carbon dioxide."),
      LessonBlock.visual("Zameen gol bani ho, us ke gird hawa ki teh kambal ki shakal me dikhe. Sooraj ki kirnein andar ati hui aur wapas jati garmi ki kirnon ka kuch hissa kambal se takra kar rukta hua dikhaya jaye. Side me factory aur gari se nikalti carbon dioxide par label lage."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Chaand, sooraj aur grehan, dikhne wali baat"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Aakhir me asmaan ki do mashhoor tasveerein. Zameen sooraj ke gird ghoomti hai aur chaand zameen ke gird ghoomta hai. Jab ghoomte ghoomte chaand sooraj aur zameen ke bilkul darmiyan me a jata hai, to chaand ka saya zameen par parta hai aur din ke waqt sooraj chhup jata hai. Isay sooraj grehan kehte hain. Aur jab zameen sooraj aur chaand ke darmiyan a jati hai, to zameen ka saya chaand par parta hai aur chaand ghana ho jata hai. Isay chaand grehan kehte hain. Farq sirf itna yaad rakho, sooraj grehan me chaand darmiyan me, chaand grehan me zameen darmiyan me. Grehan ki mukammal tafseel, chaand ki shaklain aur asmaan ki baqi cheezain Space wale hisse me hain, wahan se ye topic aur gehra ho jayega."),
      LessonBlock.visual("Do alag alag saf tasveerein hon. Pehli me sooraj, darmiyan me chaand, phir zameen aik line me, chaand ka saya zameen par parta hua dikhe aur label lage sooraj grehan. Dusri me sooraj, darmiyan me zameen, phir chaand, zameen ka saya chaand par parta hua dikhe aur label lage chaand grehan."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Aakhir me paper ke fix nuktaat"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Chalo ab poore hisse ki jaan aik jagah dohra lo. Phool ka nar hissa stamen hai aur pollen anther me banta hai. Mada hissa pistil hai, beej ovule se aur phal ovary se banta hai. Pollen ke stigma tak pohanchne ko pollination kehte hain. Photosynthesis me pauda pani, carbon dioxide aur roshni se glucose banata hai aur oxygen kharij karta hai. Patte ka sabz rang chlorophyll ki wajah se hai. Germination me sab se pehle jarr yani radicle nikalti hai, aur is ke liye pani, hawa aur munasib garmi lazmi hain. Pani ke cycle ka pehla marhala evaporation hai aur baadal condensation se bante hain. Chamak pehle is liye dikhti hai kyunke roshni ki raftaar awaaz se kahin zyada hai. Rainbow me saat rang hote hain aur tartib VIBGYOR hai. Global warming ki sab se bari wajah carbon dioxide hai. Sooraj grehan me chaand darmiyan me ata hai, chaand grehan me zameen."),
    ],
  ),
  GeoTopic(
    id: "physics-chemistry",
    title: "Rozmarra ki Physics aur Chemistry",
    subtitle: "Bijli, roshni, awaaz, tezab aur wo ajadaat jin hon ne duniya badal di",
    portion: "eds",
    blocks: <LessonBlock>[
      LessonBlock.heading("Ye hissa kyun zaroori hai"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Everyday Science ka paper adha unhi cheezon se banta hai jo tumhare ghar ke andar hain. Bulb ki roshni, pankhe ki hawa, kunwein ki ghari, sarouta, ainak, battery ka tezab, thermometer ka para. Problem ye hai ke in cheezon ko hum istemal to roz karte hain lekin kabhi in ke andar jhank kar nahi dekha. Is hisse me har cheez ko pehle tumhare samne khada karenge, kesay dikhti hai, us ke hisse konsay hain, phir wo kaam kesay karti hai, aur phir paper wala sawal. Tasveer bane gi to jawab khud bane ga."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Roshni, sab se tez musafir"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Sab se pehle wo baat jo poori science ki buniyad hai. Is kainat me sab se tez cheez roshni hai. Roshni aik second me teen lakh kilometer ka safar karti hai, yani 300,000 kilometer fi second. Zameen ke gird saat chakkar aik second me lag jayein, itni tez hai. Sooraj hum se itna door hai ke us ki roshni ko hum tak ane me taqreeban aath minute lagte hain, yani jo sooraj tum dekh rahe ho wo aath minute purana manzar hai. Roshni hamesha seedhi line me safar karti hai, isiliye saya banta hai, kyunke jahan cheez roshni ko rok le wahan peeche andhera reh jata hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab aaina samne rakho. Aaine me apna aks dekho. Aaine me tumhara dayein haath bayein taraf dikhai deta hai. Aaine me cheezain ulta is liye dikhti hain ke aaina age peeche ko ulta nahi karta, wo dayein bayein ko palat deta hai. Isi liye ambulance par lafz ulta likha hota hai taake age wali gari ke sheeshay me seedha parha jaye. Paper poochta hai, aaine me aks kesay banta hai? Roshni ke munakis hone se, jisay reflection kehte hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab lens ki baat, jo ainak aur camera ki jaan hai. Lens sheeshay ka aik tukra hota hai jo roshni ko mor deta hai. Do qismein gaur se dekho. Convex lens darmiyan se mota hota hai aur kinaron se patla, bilkul masoor ki daal ki tarah phula hua. Ye lens roshni ki kirnon ko aik nuqte par ikattha kar deta hai, isiliye is se kagaz par sooraj ki roshni jama kar ke aag bhi jalayi ja sakti hai aur khurdbeen yani magnifying glass me yehi lens chhoti cheez bari kar ke dikhata hai. Concave lens is ke ulta hai, darmiyan se patla aur kinaron se mota. Ye roshni ko ikattha karne ke bajaye phaila deta hai. Ab ainak se jodo. Jis admi ko door ki cheezain dhundli dikhti hain, us ki ainak me concave lens lagta hai. Jis ko qareeb ki kitab dhundli dikhti hai, us ke liye convex lens hota hai. Paper ka fix sawal yahi hai. Door ki nazar ki kamzori, jisay myopia kehte hain, concave lens se theek hoti hai. Qareeb ki nazar ki kamzori, hyperopia, convex lens se."),
      LessonBlock.visual("Aik taraf convex lens ki shakal dikhe, darmiyan se moti, aur us se guzar kar kirnein aik nuqte par ikatthi hoti hui, label lage convex lens aur magnifying glass. Dusri taraf concave lens darmiyan se patli, kirnein phailti hui, label lage concave lens. Neeche ainak ki tasveer me dono lenson ki jagah nishan se dikhayi jaye."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Awaaz, lehrain jo sunai deti hain"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Awaaz asal me hawa ke kaanpne ka naam hai. Jab ghanti bajti hai to wo kaanpti hai aur apne gird ki hawa ko bhi kaanpne par majboor kar deti hai. Ye kaanpna lehar ban kar tumhare kaan tak jata hai. Awaaz ki raftaar hawa me taqreeban 343 meter fi second hai. Roshni se muqabla karo, roshni aik second me teen lakh kilometer aur awaaz aik second me sirf chand sau meter. Isi liye toofan me chamak pehle aur garaj baad me ati hai, jesa pehle hisse me parha tha."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Do bareek baatain paper ki jaan hain. Pehli, awaaz ko safar ke liye koi cheez chahiye, hawa ho, pani ho ya loha. Khali jagah jahan hawa hi nahi, jisay vacuum kehte hain, wahan awaaz safar hi nahi kar sakti. Chaand par hawa nahi hai, is liye wahan do admi paas khade ho kar bhi aik dusre ki awaaz nahi sun sakte. Dusri, awaaz thos cheezon me sab se tez safar karti hai, phir pani me, aur hawa me sab se sust. Rail ki patri par kaan lagane se train ki awaaz door se sunai dena isi ki misaal hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab goonj yani echo samjho. Tum kisi bade khali hall ya pahari ke samne zor se awaaz lagao, tumhari awaaz takra kar wapas ati hai. Yehi wapas ane wali awaaz echo hai. Lekin echo sunne ke liye deewar kam az kam taqreeban 17 meter door honi chahiye, kyunke hamara kaan do awaazon ko tabhi alag sunta hai jab un ke darmiyan thoda sa waqfa ho. Kunwein me awaaz lagane par jo jawab sa ata hai, wo bhi echo hai. Paper poochta hai, awaaz khala me safar kyun nahi karti? Kyunke use koi medium chahiye hota hai."),
      LessonBlock.visual("Aik admi pahar ke samne khada awaaz laga raha ho, us ke munh se lehrain nikal kar pahar se takrati aur wapas ati hui dikhen, fasle par 17 meter ka label lage. Side me chaand par khade do admi dikhaye jayen jin ke darmiyan khamoshi ka nishan ho, label lage vacuum me awaaz nahi."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Bijli, taar ke andar dodti taaqat"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Bijli ko teen lafzon se samjho, bilkul pani ki naali ki misaal se. Voltage ko pani ka dabao samjho, dabao zyada to pani tez behta hai. Ampere current ki miqdar hai, yani kitni bijli beh rahi hai, jese naali me kitna pani beh raha hai. Aur watt taaqat ki ikai hai, koi cheez kitni bijli kha rahi hai. Bulb par 100 watt likha hota hai, is ka matlab hai wo har second me itni taaqat khata hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab wo baat jo har ghar ke bill par ati hai. Ghar ki bijli units me ginni jati hai, aur aik unit ka matlab hai aik kilowatt hour, jisay mukhtasar me kWh likhte hain. Yani aik hazar watt ki cheez aik ghanta chale to aik unit banti hai. Paper ka fix sawal hai, bijli ka unit kis me naapa jata hai? Kilowatt hour me."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Hifazat wali do cheezain gaur se dekho. Fuse aik patli si taar hoti hai jo meter ke paas lagi hoti hai. Jab bijli had se zyada guzarne lagti hai to ye patli taar garam ho kar pighal jati hai aur raasta kat deti hai, yun poore ghar ki mehngi cheezain jalne se bach jati hain. Fuse apni jaan de kar ghar bachata hai. MCB is ka jadeed roop hai, ye taar nahi aik switch hai, zyada bijli ane par ye khud band ho jata hai yani trip kar jata hai, aur theek kar ke dobara on kar sakte ho. Fuse aik dafa ka, MCB bar bar ka."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Aakhir me ye pehchan lo ke bijli kin cheezon se guzarti hai. Jin cheezon se bijli asani se guzar jaye unhe conductor kehte hain, taamba aur loha in me sab se mashhoor hain, isiliye taarein taambe ki banti hain. Jin se bijli na guzre unhe insulator kehte hain, rabbar, lakri aur plastic. Taar ke upar rabbar ka ghilaaf isiliye charhaya jata hai taake haath lagane par jhatka na lage."),
      LessonBlock.visual("Aik ghar ka meter aur us ke sath fuse ki patli taar bari kar ke dikhayi jaye, label lage fuse. Us ke sath MCB ka switch on aur trip ki halat me dikhe. Neeche taambe ki taar ka ghilaaf kaat kar andar ki taar dikhayi jaye, taar par conductor aur rabbar par insulator ka label lage."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Simple machines, kaam asaan karne wale purane dost"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Insaan ne kaam asaan karne ke liye chand saada cheezain banayi, inhe simple machines kehte hain. Teen mashhoor machinein tumhare samne rakhte hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pehli machine lever hai, yani aik sakht lakri ya lohe ki salakh jo aik nuqte par tik kar ghoomti hai. Is nuqte ko fulcrum kehte hain. Lever ki teen qismein hain aur farq sirf itna hai ke darmiyan me kya hai. Pehli qism me fulcrum darmiyan me hota hai, jese tarazu ka palla, qainchi aur bachon ka jhoola numa seesaw. Tum aik taraf bhaar rakhte ho, dusri taraf zor lagate ho. Dusri qism me bhaar darmiyan me hota hai, jese sarouta yani nutcracker. Saroute ko zehen me lao, akhrot darmiyan me hota hai, aik sira tika hota hai, dusre sire par tum zor lagate ho, aur akhrot toot jata hai. Theli gari yani wheelbarrow bhi isi qism ki hai. Teesri qism me zor darmiyan me lagta hai, jese chimta. Chimte me aik sira jura hota hai, darmiyan me ungliyan zor lagati hain, aur dusre sire par roti pakri jati hai. Belcha bhi isi qism me ginna jata hai, haath darmiyan me zor lagata hai aur mitti sire par uthti hai. Paper teeno qismon ki misaal ghuma kar poochta hai, is liye har qism ko us ki cheez se jod kar yaad rakho. Fulcrum darmiyan to tarazu, bhaar darmiyan to sarouta, zor darmiyan to chimta."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Dusri machine pulley hai, yani ghari ya charakhi. Kunwein par lagi ghari tum ne dekhi hogi. Rassi ghari ke gird lapeti jati hai, aik sire par balti bandhi hoti hai, dusre sire ko tum neeche kheenchti ho aur balti upar a jati hai. Pulley ka asal faida ye hai ke wo zor ki simt badal deti hai. Upar kheenchna mushkil hota, neeche kheenchna asaan, ghari yehi tabdeeli kar deti hai. Jhanda buland karne wali ghari bhi yehi hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Teesri machine inclined plane hai, yani dhalaan wala rasta. Seedhi seedhi deewar par bhari cheez uthana mushkil hai, lekin dhalaan par ghaseetna asaan. Hospital aur station par bani hui ramp yehi machine hai. Pahari sarakh seedhi upar nahi jati, morr kaat kaat kar dhalaan bana kar jati hai, taake gari ko zyada zor na lagana pare. Faasla lamba ho jata hai lekin zor kam lagta hai, yehi in tamam machineon ka usool hai."),
      LessonBlock.visual("Teen alag khane banein. Pehle me tarazu aur fulcrum par label, dusre me sarouta akhrot torte hue, teesre me chimta roti pakre hue, har aik ke neeche us ki qism ka naam. Sath me kunwein ki ghari rassi aur balti ke sath, aur pahar par morr khati dhalaan wali sarakh dikhayi jaye."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Magnet, wo loha jo khud kheenchta hai"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Magnet aik aisi cheez hai jo lohe ko apni taraf kheenchti hai. Us ke do sire hote hain jinhe qatb yani pole kehte hain, aik north pole aur dusra south pole. Qanoon seedha hai. Mukhalif qatb aik dusre ko kheenchti hain, north aur south milte hain. Aik jaise qatb aik dusre ko dhakelte hain, north north ko door karta hai. Do magnet haath me le kar ye khud mehsoos hota hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab compass dekho. Compass ki chhoti si suee asal me aik chhota sa magnet hai jo azaadi se ghoom sakti hai. Zameen khud aik bohat bada magnet hai, is liye compass ki suee hamesha zameen ke north ki taraf rukh kar leti hai. Isi liye samandar ke musafir aur jangalon ke rahi compass se simt maloom karte the. Paper poochta hai, compass ki suee hamesha north kyun dikhati hai? Kyunke zameen aik bara magnet hai aur suee us ke asar me rukh karti hai."),
      LessonBlock.visual("Ghore ki naal jaisi shakal ka magnet dikhe jis ke dono siro par N aur S ke label hon, us ke paas lohe ki keelain us ki taraf khinchti hui dikhen. Side me compass ki gol tasveer ho jis ki suee north ki taraf ishara kar rahi ho."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Density, barf tairti kyun hai aur loha doobta kyun hai"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Aik sawal jo har bache ke zehen me ata hai. Lohe ki chhoti si keel pani me doob jati hai, lekin barf ka bara tukra pani par tairta hai. Jawab density me chhupa hai. Density yani kasafat ka matlab hai ke koi cheez apni jagah ke muqable me kitni bhari hai. Jo cheez pani se zyada ghani hogi, wo doobegi. Jo pani se kam ghani hogi, wo tairegi."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Barf ki kahani bareek hai. Pani jab jamta hai to dusri cheezon ki tarah sikurta nahi, balke thoda phail jata hai. Phailne se wahi wazan zyada jagah me phail gaya, kasafat kam ho gayi, is liye barf pani se halki ho kar upar tairti hai. Yehi wajah hai ke sardion me pipeon ke andar pani jam jaye to pipe phat jate hain. Aur aik pyari baat, jheelon me upar barf jam jati hai lekin neeche pani rehta hai, is liye machhliyan neeche zinda reh jati hain. Loha pani se kahin zyada ghana hai, is liye doobta hai. Lekin lohe ka jahaaz tairta hai, kyunke jahaaz andar se khokhla hota hai aur us ke andar ki hawa mila kar us ki majmooi kasafat pani se kam ho jati hai. Garam hawa bhi thandi hawa se halki hoti hai, isiliye garam hawa ka ghubaara upar uthta hai."),
      LessonBlock.visual("Aik sheeshay ke glass me pani dikhe, us me barf ka tukra upar tairta hua aur lohe ki keel neeche bethi hui, dono par density ke label hon. Side me khokhla lohe ka jahaaz samandar par tairta hua dikhaya jaye."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Tezab aur base, litmus wala khel"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab chemistry ki sab se rozmarra baat. Tezab yani acid wo cheez hai jo khatti hoti hai, jese nimbu aur sirka. Base wo cheez hai jo karwi hoti hai aur haath par phisalne wali lagti hai, jese sabun. Dono ko pehchanne ke liye aik khaas kagaz hota hai jisay litmus paper kehte hain. Qanoon yaad kar lo. Neela litmus tezab me dalo to lal ho jata hai. Lal litmus base me dalo to neela ho jata hai. Paper ka sab se mashhoor sawal yahi hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Tezab aur base ki taaqat naapne ka aik paimana hai jisay pH scale kehte hain. Ise aik lakeer ki tarah zehen me banao jis par 0 se 14 tak number likhe hain. Darmiyan wala number 7 neutral hai, yani na tezab na base, saaf pani yahin ata hai. 7 se neeche jitna jao ge tezab utna tez hota jayega. 7 se upar jitna jao ge base utni tez hoti jayegi. Maiday ka tezab 1 aur 2 ke paas hai, sabun 9 aur 10 ke paas."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab ghar ki cheezon se jodo. Sirke me acetic acid hota hai. Nimbu aur sangtare me citric acid hota hai. Gari ki battery me sulfuric acid hota hai, ye bohat tez tezab hai. Tumhare maiday me hydrochloric acid hota hai jo khana hazam karta hai, jab ye zyada ho jaye to seene me jalan hoti hai jisay tezabiyat kehte hain. Base ki misaalon me sabun, toothpaste aur chuna mashhoor hain. Toothpaste base is liye hota hai taake munh ke tezab ko khatam kare. Aik desi indicator bhi yaad rakho, haldi. Haldi wala rang base me par kar lal bhura sa ho jata hai, sabun ke daagh par kapra haldi se ragro to yahi hota hai. Aakhir me ye baat ke tezab aur base mil jayen to aik dusre ko khatam kar dete hain, namak aur pani ban jata hai, isay neutralization kehte hain. Chinti kaate to us ke tezab par khane ka soda lagana isi usool par hai."),
      LessonBlock.visual("Aik lambi patti dikhe jis par 0 se 14 tak number hon, neeche walay hisse par tezab ka label aur nimbu battery ki chhoti nishaniyan, darmiyan 7 par pani ka glass, upar walay hisse par base ka label aur sabun ki tasveer. Side me neela litmus kagaz tezab ke glass me lal hota hua dikhaya jaye."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Hawa aur pani, do zaroori cheezain gin kar"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Hum jis hawa me saans lete hain wo aik gas nahi, kai gason ka majmua hai. Is ke hisse gin lo. Sab se zyada nitrogen hai, taqreeban 78 feesad. Dusre number par oxygen hai, taqreeban 21 feesad, yehi wo gas hai jis par hamari zindagi hai. Baqi sirf aik feesad me argon, carbon dioxide aur dusri gasain ati hain. Paper hamesha ye phansata hai ke hawa me sab se zyada konsi gas hai, aksar student oxygen likh deta hai, jabke sahi jawab nitrogen hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pani ka formula har student ne suna hoga, H2O. Is ka matlab hai pani ke har hisse me hydrogen ke do hisse aur oxygen ka aik hissa hota hai. Pani 0 degree centigrade par jam kar barf ban jata hai aur 100 degree centigrade par ubal kar bhaap ban jata hai. Ye do number paper ke fix number hain. Aik bareeki ye bhi hai ke pani garam ho ya thanda, wo hamesha upar se jamna shuru hota hai kyunke barf halki ho kar upar a jati hai, jesa density wale hisse me parha."),
      LessonBlock.visual("Hawa ke liye aik gol dayra dikhe jis ka bada hissa nitrogen 78 feesad ke label ke sath, dusra hissa oxygen 21 feesad, aur aik bareek si patti baqi gason ki. Pani ke liye thermometer par 0 aur 100 ke nishan lage dikhaye jayen, aik taraf barf aur dusri taraf ubalta pani."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Dhaten, para, tungsten aur zang"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Aakhir me chand mashhoor dhaton ki pehchan kar lo. Mercury yani para wohi chaandi jaisa chamakta hua mada hai jo purane thermometer ke andar hota tha. Ye duniya ki wahid dhat hai jo aam darja hararat par maye yani liquid halat me hoti hai, baqi tamam dhaten thos hain. Paper ka fix sawal yahi hai, liquid metal konsi hai? Mercury. Tungsten wo dhat hai jis ka bareek taar bulb ke andar hota hai, isay filament kehte hain. Tungsten is liye chuni gayi kyunke ye sab se zyada garmi bardasht karti hai aur pighle baghair garam ho kar roshni deti hai. Sona is liye qeemti hai ke use zang nahi lagta, hawa aur pani us par asar nahi karte, hazaron saal purana sona bhi chamakta milta hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Lohe ko zang kesay lagta hai, ye bhi samajh lo. Zang lagne ke liye do cheezain lazmi hain, hawa ki oxygen aur nami yani pani. Geeli hawa me rakha loha ahista ahista bhoore rang ki teh se dhak jata hai, yehi zang hai jo lohe ko kha kar kamzor kar deta hai. Isiliye lohe par rangat yani paint kiya jata hai taake hawa aur nami us tak na pohanch sakein. Khushk registan me loha der tak zang nahi khata, samandar ke kinare sab se jaldi khata hai."),
      LessonBlock.visual("Thermometer bari shakal me dikhe jis ke andar chaandi jaisi mercury ki lakeer par label lage. Sath me bulb ka andar wala filament taar jalta hua dikhaya jaye jis par tungsten likha ho. Neeche aik zang lagi keel aur aik chamakti sone ki angoothi ka muqabla dikhe."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Aijadaat aur scientists, cheez aur us ka banane wala"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Aakhir me un logon ko pehchano jin ki banayi cheezain tum roz istemal karte ho. Har aik ke sath ye bhi yaad rakho ke wo cheez asal me dikhti kaisi thi."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Bulb Thomas Edison ne banaya. Pehla bulb aj ke bulb jaisa hi gol sheeshay ka gola tha jis ke andar bareek taar jalta tha, lekin roshni peeli aur maddham thi. Telephone Alexander Graham Bell ne banaya, pehla telephone lakri ke dabbe jaisi ajeeb si cheez tha jis par bolna aur sunna aik hi hisse se hota tha. Radio Guglielmo Marconi ne banaya, us ne hawa ke zariye baghair taar ke awaaz aur ishare bhejne ka pehla kamyab tajriba kiya, pehle radio bade bade dabbe aur lambi antena wale hote the. Jahaz yani aeroplane Wright brothers ne banaya, un ka pehla jahaz lakri aur kapre ka bana hua tha aur sirf 12 second ura tha. Steam engine James Watt ne behtar banaya, ye wahi engine hai jo pehle karkhanon aur phir rail gari ko chalata raha, bara sa lohe ka dhacha jis me bhaap pistano ko dhakelti thi. Printing press Johannes Gutenberg ne banaya, is se pehle kitabein haath se likhi jati thi aur bohat mehngi hoti thi, press ke baad kitabein aam ho gayin."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Telescope Galileo ne behtar kar ke asmaan ki taraf uthaya aur chaand ke garhay aur Jupiter ke chaand pehli dafa dekhe, pehli telescope lambi si naali jaisi hoti thi. X-ray Wilhelm Roentgen ne daryaft ki, ye wo roshni hai jo jism ke andar ki haddi ki tasveer bana deti hai. Penicillin Alexander Fleming ne daryaft ki, ye duniya ki pehli mashhoor antibiotic dawa hai aur mazay ki baat ye ke ye aik phaphundi yani mold se mili thi, Fleming ne dekha ke jahan phaphundi lagi hai wahan jaraseem mar rahe hain. Gravity yani kashish ka qanoon Isaac Newton se jura hai, riwayat hai ke darakht se seb girta dekh kar us ke zehen me sawal aya ke seb neeche hi kyun gira, aur yahi soch age chal kar poori zameen aur chaand ko jodne wale qanoon bani. Charles Babbage ko father of computer kehte hain, us ne aik aisi machine ka naksha banaya tha jo hisaab khud kar sake, wo machine us ke zamane me ban na saki lekin aj ka computer usi soch ki aulaad hai. Periodic table Dmitri Mendeleev ne banayi, ye wahi bada sa chart hai jo chemistry ki class ki deewar par laga hota hai jis me tamam anasir tartib se likhe hote hain. Evolution yani irtiqa ka nazariya Charles Darwin ne diya, us ne door daraz ke jazeeron par chidiyon ki chonchon ka farq dekh kar ye samjhaya ke jandaar waqt ke sath mahol ke mutabiq badalte hain. Marie Curie radioactivity par kaam karne wali sab se mashhoor scientist hain, unhon ne do naye anasir daryaft kiye, aur wo wahid shakhs hain jinhe do mukhtalif science ke shobon, physics aur chemistry, me Nobel inaam mila."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper in sawalon ko do tarah banata hai. Kabhi cheez de kar banane wala poochta hai, telephone kis ne banaya? Aur kabhi naam de kar cheez poochta hai, Fleming kis liye mashhoor hai? Dono taraf se tayyar raho."),
      LessonBlock.visual("Har scientist ke liye chhoti si khana bandi tasveer ho jis me aik taraf us ki ijad ki purani shakal dikhe, jese lakri kapre wala pehla jahaz, dabbe jaisa pehla telephone, naali jaisi telescope, aur neeche naam aur ijad ka label lage."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Aakhir me paper ke fix nuktaat"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Poore hisse ki jaan dohra lo. Roshni ki raftaar teen lakh kilometer fi second hai aur ye sab se tez hai. Door ki nazar concave lens se aur qareeb ki nazar convex lens se theek hoti hai. Awaaz ki raftaar hawa me taqreeban 343 meter fi second hai aur awaaz vacuum me safar nahi kar sakti. Bijli ka unit kilowatt hour yani kWh hai. Fuse patli taar hoti hai jo zyada bijli par pighal jati hai. Taamba conductor hai, rabbar insulator. Lever ki dusri qism ki misaal sarouta hai, teesri qism ki chimta. Compass ki suee zameen ke magnet ki wajah se north dikhati hai. Barf pani se kam ghani hoti hai is liye tairti hai. Neela litmus tezab me lal ho jata hai. pH 7 neutral hai. Hawa me sab se zyada gas nitrogen hai, 78 feesad. Pani 0 degree par jamta hai aur 100 degree par ubalta hai. Liquid dhat mercury hai aur bulb ka filament tungsten ka hota hai. Father of computer Charles Babbage hai aur do Nobel pane wali scientist Marie Curie hain."),
    ],
  ),
];
